    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位年輕人……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道含羞苞是什麼嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D5E748F154EBA20262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053542B7F9E82DE662F4EC09EBC55CEFF1F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "羞羞咻♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F9E7F9E54BB266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠是一種寶可夢，\n會在嚴寒中忍耐直到花苞綻放。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260662F4E007A2E5BF653EF5922FF0C000A6703572856B45BD24E2D5FCD801076F4523082B182DE7DBB653E300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老夫從<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳身上感受到一股能讓\n含羞苞綻放的訓練家所具有的才華。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來參加我們的品評會可好？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001592B5F9E00100003110000FF01014F6059B38EAB4E0A611F53D752304E0080A180FD8B93000A542B7F9E82DE7DBB653E76848A137DF45BB66240517767097684624D83EF300200100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F8653C352A062115011768454C18A55670353EF597DFF1F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到浦藍8號街區的噴水池廣場吧……\n老夫等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B352306D6685CD0038865F88575340768456746C346C605EE35834542720262026000A8001592B7B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B3554A300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對含羞苞而言，\n最重要的就是要長得健壯唷。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D542B7F9E82DE800C8A00FF0C000A670091CD898176845C31662F898195775F97506558EF5537300200100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想從含羞苞的表情、動作中\n發現牠本身的藝術性。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F35F9E542B7F9E82DE7684886860C5300152D54F5C4E2D000A767C73FE7260672C8EAB768485DD88536027300200100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老夫正等著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001592B6B637B49845700100003110000FF01014F6059B34F86554A300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳沒帶上最要緊的含羞苞呢。\n把牠加入到同行隊伍裡再來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B36C925E364E0A670089817DCA7684542B7F9E82DE54623002000A628A726052A051655230540C884C968A4F0D88E1518D4F865427300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把含羞苞也\n確實帶來了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A542B7F9E82DE4E5F000A78BA5BE65E364F864E86300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的名字是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>是吧。\n一聽就是個會開出個什麼花兒來的名字。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684540D5B57662F202620260010000201000000662F54273002000A4E00807D5C31662F500B6703958B51FA500B4EC09EBC82B151524F867684540D5B57300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "參加品評會得要繳\n報名費<U+E300>5800。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C352A054C18A5567035F9789817E73000A5831540D8CBBE3000035003800300030300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "繳費吧……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E738CBB542720262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要收錢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898165369322FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放一百二十個心！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和含羞苞肯定行的啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E4E00767E4E8C5341500B5FC3FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C542B7F9E82DE80AF5B9A884C76845566FF0100100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的錢似乎不夠呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768493224F3C4E4E4E0D592054622026202600100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "品評會有得期待囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C18A55670367095F97671F5F8556C9300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
