      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56298446FF5E202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "體型非常大唷。\n花粉量也很充足呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9AD4578B975E5E38592755373002000A82B17C8991CF4E5F5F8851458DB35462300200100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "動作強而有勁，\n看得我心花怒放！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52D54F5C5F37800C670952C1FF0C000A770B5F9762115FC382B16012653EFF0100100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但叫聲中帶著煩躁……\n似乎是累積了一些壓力啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4653EB80724E2D5E36845771698E8120262026000A4F3C4E4E662F7D2F7A4D4E864E004E9B58D3529B554A300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最後是4號參加者，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的含羞苞。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67005F8C662F0034865F53C352A08005FF0C000A00100002010000007684542B7F9E82DE300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咻苞！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54BB82DEFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是……！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F20262026FF01FF1F00100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的天啊……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845929554A20262026FF0100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這生氣蓬勃的色澤，\n水嫩嫩、滑溜溜的花苞！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019751F6C2384EC52C3768482726FA4FF0C000A6C345AE95AE930016ED16E9C6E9C768482B182DEFF0100100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "輕巧曼妙的步伐，\n扣人心弦的表情。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F155DE766FC599976846B654F10FF0C000A62634EBA5FC35F267684886860C5300200100002011401930000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只是外觀……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
